13:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose-custom max-w-none","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["# Abandoned Cart Email Recovery: Strategies That Recover 15%+ of Lost Sales"]}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Excerpt:"}]," Cart abandonment emails are the highest-converting automated campaigns. This guide covers timing, sequencing, and discount strategies -- backed by real data and field-tested tactics that consistently recover ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"15-35% of abandoned carts"}],", according to industry benchmarks from Klaviyo, Omnisend, and Shopify."]}],["$","hr","4",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","6",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"Why Abandoned Cart Emails Are Your Highest-ROI Automation"}],["$","p","8",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Let's start with a sobering statistic: ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"70.19% of online shopping carts are abandoned"}],", per the latest Baymard Institute (2024) analysis of 4.4 million e-commerce sessions. That means for every 100 visitors who add items to their cart, ~70 walk away -- *without buying*."]}],["$","p","10",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Yet here's the opportunity: ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"abandoned cart emails convert at an average rate of 15.6%"}],", outperforming welcome emails (12.3%), post-purchase follow-ups (8.7%), and even browse abandonment sequences (10.1%) -- according to Klaviyo's 2023 Benchmark Report (n = 12,500+ brands)."]}],["$","p","12",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Why? Because these subscribers have already demonstrated high purchase intent: they selected products, compared options, entered shipping details (in many cases), and signaled readiness -- only to pause, not reject."]}],["$","p","14",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["The result? A single automated sequence can recover ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"$$1.25-$3.80 in revenue for every $1 spent on email infrastructure"}],", per Shopify's 2023 Merchant Impact Study."]}],["$","p","16",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Let's break down exactly how to replicate -- and exceed -- that performance."]}],["$","hr","18",{"className":"border-[#5F1E1E] my-8"}],["$","h2","20",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"⏱️ Timing Matters More Than You Think"}],["$","p","22",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Your first email shouldn't wait. Delay kills recovery."]}],["$","p","24",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Send Email #1 within 1 hour"}]," of abandonment."]}],["$","p","25",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["*Why?* 42% of recovered carts happen within the first 60 minutes (Omnisend, 2023). Waiting until \"next morning\" drops open rates by 27% and conversion by 34%."]}],["$","p","27",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- ✅ ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"Email #2 at 24 hours"}]," -- gentle reminder + social proof."]}],"$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31","$L32","$L33","$L34","$L35","$L36","$L37","$L38